        },
        "body": "happy to be wrong on this but in my own practice I generally avoid `delete` as the education I've received has been that it's bad to use and that's been reinforced by code style tooling I've always used. \n\nIt doesn't seem like we use it [anywhere else in the codebase](https://github.com/search?q=repo%3Anodejs%2Fnode%20delete&type=code) in this way. I don't have a direct recommendation on what to replace it with, but I'm cautious to see us introduce it as a precedent with this PR.",
